{"quest_id": 4326, "name": "孤児院防衛戦", "description": "魔物が街へ進行中との報告を受け\n迎撃に向かった王子たち。\nそこには一人で戦う少女の姿が…。\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "大地を震わす必殺剣", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920045, "map_no": 3588, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 16, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 34, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 13}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 19}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 34}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 142, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098272, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 82, "global_id": 81, "spawn_sec": 74}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "level": 85, "form_count": 1, "hp": 15000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 15000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 90, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 186, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2098288, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 83, "global_id": 82, "spawn_sec": 74}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王城に戻ったばかりでしたが、すぐに魔物が\n出てくるとは……。\n王子、街に行く前にここで食い止めましょう。", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……？　私たちより先に戦っている方が……。\nあれは……！", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "私の大事なものを、これ以上奪わせないっ……！", "face": "u1111"}, {"name": "グローリア", "text": "魔物……！　魔物はあたしがこの世から……！！\nぐぅっ！……あいつらは敵……！　敵……！", "face": "u259"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、私たちも加勢しましょう！", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "やはり、先に戦っていたのは\nユリナさんだったんですね。\nどうして一人で戦って……。", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}, {"name": "ユリナ", "text": "ここには私が建てた孤児院があるんだ。\n私の数少ない大事なものだからな。\nそれより……あなた、そのまま戦っていると危ない。", "face": "u1111"}, {"name": "グローリア", "text": "……。", "face": "u259"}, {"name": "ユリナ", "text": "先ほどの戦い方では、魔物を憎む気持ちが\n強すぎるがゆえ、心に隙ができて\n操られてしまう。", "face": "u1111"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……。王子、もしかしたらユリナさんなら\nグローリアさんを救えるかもしれません。", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "ひとまずここは一旦王城へ戻りましょう。", "face": "ld0ac95360ade"}]}], "active": true}